# Mang Crinkle — Figma to code

Figma file: [`sYXsKO9gMyZ60JupTNPi4G`](https://www.figma.com/design/sYXsKO9gMyZ60JupTNPi4G/Mang-Crinkle) (Mang Crinkle).

When implementing from a Figma URL or selection:

1. Call `get_design_context` on the **node** (always need `node-id`).
2. **Reuse** the mapped components below — do not invent parallel buttons, cards, or headers.
3. Use **`mang-*` tokens** from `src/app/globals.css` (cream, brown, orange, tan). Map Figma CSS vars (`--color/cream`, `--color/brown`, etc.) to these.
4. Prefer editing the mapped file over creating a new one.

