## Assets

Downloaded Figma media lives under `public/images/figma/` (e.g. `hero-crinkles.jpg`, `signature-ube.jpg`). Prefer these (or Strapi URLs) over temporary MCP asset URLs.

## Do not

- Recreate a slide-over cart drawer — cart is full-page `/cart`.
- Paste Figma MCP reference React verbatim — adapt to App Router + existing components.
- Add new purple/glow/generic AI themes — stay on mang palette.
